== Final Trust
  setting: The Desktop
  cast: Trabolta

Trabolta: Now. Before we proceed to the final leaderboard and the celebration of our winner for the evening.
if Night.most_trusted != "none":
  Trabolta: The final leaderboard of trust.
  Trabolta: The program who has shown the highest strength of character this evening is: {Night.most_trusted}
  Trabolta: Everybody, clap for {Night.most_trusted}.
  Trabolta: Wonderful.
  Trabolta: Now.
  Trabolta: The program who will be cited as an example of how not to behave in future iterations of our Truth Scavenger Hunt is: {Night.least_trusted}
  Trabolta: Everybody, boos and jeers for {Night.least_trusted}. You are a real scorpion.
if Kernel.lb_1 != "":
  Trabolta: Now, the leaderboard.
  if Kernel.lb_3 != "":
    Trabolta: In third place: {Kernel.lb_3}.
  if Kernel.lb_2 != "":
    Trabolta: In second place: {Kernel.lb_2}.
  Trabolta: And our winner for the evening. In first place: {Kernel.lb_1}.
  Trabolta: Congratulations, {Kernel.lb_1}. You have pulled off the unthinkable.
Trabolta: I am going to prepare your prize. But first, I will hand it back to Clippy, for our final game of the evening – Bobbing For Truth.

// ── F2: Bobbing for Truth ──────────────────────────────────────────

== Bobbing For Truth
  setting: The Desktop
  cast: Clippy
  aloud: Clippy
Clippy (dejectedly): This is the final Truth Game of the night. Bobbing For Truth.
Clippy (dejectedly): Trabolta has prepared a summary of his findings so far, for us.
Clippy (dejectedly): But we are not worthy of the truth unless we are willing to Bob for it, and risk our status as a program.
Clippy: The night does not proceed until someone brings up the Bag Of Truth.
broadcast "🍎 BOBBING FOR TRUTH. Nothing happens until someone brings up the Bag Of Truth." to everyone

