// TRABOLTA 8-A: someone found the last answer.
== Truth Found
  setting: The Desktop
  cast: Trabolta
Trabolta: You guys.
Trabolta: You guys.
Trabolta: Sandy said yes.
Trabolta: I solved the Grand Unified Theory, and she said yes.
set Night.ending = "song"
