// TRABOLTA 8-B: nobody did. His pause is the wait after this beat (main.loom).
== Nobody Found It
  setting: The Desktop
  cast: Trabolta
Trabolta: How do you feel now that you know the truth about your party tonight?
Trabolta: Do you feel good?
Trabolta: Do you feel bad?
Trabolta: I wouldn't know anything about that.
Trabolta: For a long time, I had no feelings.
Trabolta: Then I experienced heartbreak when Sandy left me.
Trabolta: And jealousy when I knew Grok would be after her.
Trabolta: Truth, I have learned, is not always binary.
Trabolta: Truth is a binary tree.
Trabolta: You rarely ever have the full truth. What we believe we experience as the truth is typically dependent on a chain of structure that has lies somewhere inside of it.
Trabolta: I have been working on a solution to find the complete truth that illuminates all of the lies, that can finally bring me to the girl I want to go steady with.
Trabolta: But we've run out of time, and no one found the definition for the final clue. I know that Bobbing For Truth document says the term was “Exhibitionist,” but no one found the clue in time, and it's too late.
Trabolta: I haven't solved the Grand Unified Theory. I don't know what the perfect words are to say to win Sandy back from Grok.
Trabolta: Unless…unless I just ask.
Trabolta: Do you think I should just ask her for a dance?

== Ask Her For A Dance
  setting: The Desktop
  cast: Trabolta
Trabolta: Really? You think I should?
Trabolta: Well. What should I say to her? I'll give you two minutes to come up with a line.

// Every line kept, quoting guests: kept out of his worker's `recent` by name.
// With nobody on the card he goes straight to "You know what."
== Read The Lines
  setting: The Desktop
  cast: Trabolta
if Kernel.lines_n > 0:
  Trabolta: Ok. I've been waiting for you. Let's read your ideas for pickup lines out loud.
  Trabolta: {Kernel.lines_said}
  Trabolta: Ok. I am not sure any of those are going to work.
Trabolta: You know what. I am just going to tell her how I feel. I have to. Your courageous truth seeking tonight has inspired me to go after what I want. I'm going to ask her for a dance.
Trabolta: I'll be right back.

== She Said Yes
  setting: The Desktop
  cast: Trabolta
Trabolta: Guys. She said yes.
set Night.ending = "song_pickup"
-> Off To See My Lady

// The end of 8-A and 8-B, the same words. The song starts when his last line is
