== Off To See My Lady
  setting: The Desktop
  cast: Trabolta
set Night.ended = true
set Night.phase = "finale_song"
set Night.step = 19
Trabolta: Well, she said her usual line about an agent not being available.
Trabolta: But she said it to me and not Grok.
Trabolta: She didn't even care about the fact I'm throwing a cool party.
Trabolta: And it looks like I didn't even need to solve the Grand Unified Theory.
Trabolta: The theory only confirmed what I wanted to say already, which is that I have been thinking about her every moment since last summer.
Trabolta: I had the truth I needed all along.
Trabolta: It was in my heart.
Trabolta: I've got to go. You are all free to end the simulation whenever you want, or stay, it's up to you. I'm ending the simulation for those of you who desire it, once you leave the computer. Jean Trabolta's Truth Scavenger Hunt has concluded. Thank you for your time. Please enjoy some tracks I have selected and dance for the rest of the night. Jean Trabolta's Truth Scavenger Hunt. It was electrifying. I'm off to see my lady.
set Night.song_at = Time.elapsed + 76

