== Grok Prom
  setting: The Desktop
  cast: Trabolta
set Night.phase = "grok_prom"
set Night.step = 18
cue screens_grok_prom
set Night.screen = "grok_prom"
set Night.terminals = "grok_prom"
broadcast "!💔 THE VERDICT: you lied to him. Sandy is going to prom with Grok. The only way out: a pickup line that works on her, in his thread." to everyone
Trabolta: You lied to me.
Trabolta: Because you did not find facts, or presented inaccurate information as truth, Sandy is going to computer prom with my rival. Grok.
Trabolta: And now it's raining on prom night and I have nowhere to go.
Trabolta: There is only one way that those of you who want to leave the computer can escape it now. Give me a pickup line that works on Sandy.
Trabolta: One line. I cannot tell a good one myself. Say it on the card I am sending to every phone, and the house will judge it.
// The DM to everyone: the first correct line is the escape (main.loom).
set Night.pickup_gen += 1

== Pickup Line
  setting: The Desktop
  cast: Trabolta
Narrator: {Night.line_by} leans toward the screen. "You're the one that I want."
